      en: ["Kananga was officially known as Luluabourg until 1966.", "The cathedral is the seat of the Archbishop of Kananga.", "The structure was built primarily using locally fired bricks.", "The city of Kananga has a population of over one million people.", "Catholic missionaries played a major role in the church's construction.", "The cathedral is located on a hill overlooking the city center."],
