      en: ["The stadium has an official seating capacity of 35,000 spectators.", "It was originally opened under the name Stade de la Kenya.", "The venue is named after Frédéric Kibassa Maliba, a prominent Katangan politician.", "FC Saint-Eloi Lupopo uses the stadium as its primary home ground.", "Major renovation works were carried out between 2022 and 2023.", "It served as the home of the successful TP Mazembe club for decades."],
